         and says so explicitly:
             Instances other than config are configured per-device, depending
             on the slot count (framework currently supports slot1, slot2 and
             slot3) and Radio HALs device wishes to provide.
         beyond1q is a dual-SIM device, so slot1 and slot2 are declared for
         every interface. Without these the framework logs
             Could not find android.hardware.radio.modem.IRadioModem/slot1
